{
 "description": "The same connected-cumulant hierarchy evaluated on small tori where exact values exist. 4x2 and 4x4: all four sectors and all nine (rank, cutoff) settings, same mixed-precision arithmetic as the 6x6 production (role \"calibration\"; the rank-6 cutoff-6 residuals define R). 8x2: rank 6, cutoffs 4-6, float64 projection, values as reported to 15 significant digits (role \"validation\"; not used to define R). Role \"holdout_proxy\": rank-6 cutoff-4/5 values of an earlier float64 evaluation on 4x2/4x4, frozen before any cutoff-6 value was computed; they define the leave-one-lattice-out hold-out proxies. residual = A - exact. Uniform means exclude holdout_proxy rows.",
 "observable": "A = (2/N) [ <D> - <eta+ eta-> ], D = sum_i n_i,up n_i,down, eta- = sum_i (-1)^(x_i+y_i) c_i,down c_i,up",
